 rtal still shows the closed 2026 call. The March 10\, 2027 deadline for p
 apers\, podium abstracts and posters is a one-year proxy from AMIA 2026 (
 one deadline\, Mar 10\, 2026\, 11:59 p.m. Eastern\; 2025 was Mar 19\, ext
 ended to Mar 25)\, kept at 11:59 p.m. Eastern (EST on that date). Both ea
 rlier portals were open by mid-January. Papers appear in the PMC-archived
  proceedings\; podium abstracts and posters are not MEDLINE-indexed. Size
  is an editorial estimate.
